{"title": "Unknown", "index": 21, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre2\">\n<div class=\"calibre3\" id=\"Section0016_0001.xhtml\">\n<p class=\"calibre7\"><span class=\"calibre19\">而你，</span></p>\n<p class=\"calibre7\"><span class=\"calibre19\">你为澄澈的一日而生。</span></p>\n<p class=\"calibre7\"><span class=\"calibre20\">——荷尔德林</span></p></div>\n</body>"}]}